.TH FL-TERM 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-term \- terminal emulator
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-term\fR [\fB\-d\fR \fIDIR\fR] [\fB\-T\fR \fITITLE\fR] [\fB\-g\fR \fICOLS\fRx\fIROWS\fR] [\fB\-\-hold\fR] [\fB\-e\fR \fICOMMAND\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A terminal emulator using libvterm. Ctrl+Shift+C/V copy and paste, Shift+PageUp/Down
scroll, Ctrl+plus/minus/0 change the font size, Ctrl+Shift+N opens a new window.
Settings: \fI~/.config/fldesktop/term.ini\fR [Terminal] ColorScheme (dark, light),
FontSize, Scrollback.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-e COMMAND...\fR
Run COMMAND instead of the shell.
.TP
\fB\-d DIR\fR
Start in DIR.
.TP
\fB\-T TITLE\fR
Fixed window title.
.TP
\fB\-g COLSxROWS\fR
Initial size.
.TP
\fB\-\-hold\fR
Keep the window open after the command exits.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
